<div id="S3.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_remark">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S3.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Remark 3.2</span></span><span id="S3.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S3.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Recall the edge-labellings <math id="S3.Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{J}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>J</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{J}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.Thmtheorem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{M}</annotation></semantics></math> from <a href="#S2" title="2. Background ‣ Extremality in semidistributive lattices" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. If <math id="S3.Thmtheorem2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math> is semidistributive, then <math id="S3.Thmtheorem2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{J}(b\lessdot c)=j\Longrightarrow\gamma_{1}(b\lessdot c)=\delta(j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>J</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋖</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟹</mo><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋖</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{J}(b\lessdot c)=j\Longrightarrow\gamma_{1}(b\lessdot c)=\delta(j)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.Thmtheorem2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{M}(b\lessdot c)=m\Longrightarrow\gamma_{2}(b\lessdot c)=\beta(m)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋖</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">⟹</mo><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋖</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{M}(b\lessdot c)=m\Longrightarrow\gamma_{2}(b\lessdot c)=\beta(m)</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</div>
