</figure>
<div id="S3.SS4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">From now on in this section, all directed graphs and multigraphs are assumed to have a loop at every vertex, but they are not represented on the figures. An illustration of the following definitions is given in <a href="#S3.F5" title="In 3.4. Induced subgraphs of a canonical join graph ‣ 3. The main results ‣ Extremality in semidistributive lattices" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Fig.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
